﻿# MaintiQ

**Industrial Failure Prediction with Explainable Artificial Intelligence**

A desktop decision-support prototype for binary machine-failure prediction using the AI4I 2020 Predictive Maintenance dataset. Built as a Python package with a native PySide6 GUI, four candidate classifiers, SHAP/LIME explainability, a JSON-backed model registry, and report export.

