│       ├── reporting/      # JSON, CSV, PNG export service
│       ├── services/       # ApplicationService orchestration
│       └── ui/             # PySide6 GUI: app, main_window, pages, widgets,
│       │                   # worker, signals, styles
├── tests/
│   ├── unit/               # Unit tests
│   ├── integration/        # Integration and security tests
│   └── gui/                # GUI tests (Qt offscreen)
├── .gitignore
├── CHANGELOG.md
├── pyproject.toml
├── requirements.txt
├── requirements-dev.txt
├── requirements-packaging.txt
└── README.md
```

Excluded from this tree: virtual environments (`.venv/`), cache directories (`__pycache__/`, `.pytest_cache/`, `.ruff_cache/`), build artefacts (`build/`, `release/`, `*.egg-info/`), and temporary files.

