## Academic Context

MaintiQ is presented as a Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) capstone project. The project uses the public AI4I 2020 Predictive Maintenance Dataset from the UCI Machine Learning Repository.

**Academic integrity notice.** MaintiQ is an academic decision-support prototype. Predictions and explanations are model outputs, not certified industrial diagnoses or maintenance instructions. Qualified human review is required. The application does not connect to physical machinery or industrial control systems.

No university approvals, awards, certifications, or guide endorsements are claimed. No internal AI development prompts, conversation logs, or execution instructions are referenced in this documentation.

